{"words": [{"text": "خَتَمَ", "translation": "Has set a seal"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "on"}, {"text": "قُلُوبِهِمْ", "translation": "their hearts"}, {"text": "وَعَلَىٰ", "translation": "and on"}, {"text": "سَمْعِهِمْ ۖ", "translation": "their hearing"}, {"text": "وَعَلَىٰٓ", "translation": "and on"}, {"text": "أَبْصَـٰرِهِمْ", "translation": "their vision"}, {"text": "غِشَـٰوَةٌۭ ۖ", "translation": "(is) a veil"}, {"text": "وَلَهُمْ", "translation": "And for them"}, {"text": "عَذَابٌ", "translation": "(is) a punishment"}, {"text": "عَظِيمٌۭ", "translation": "great"}], "sahih": "Allāh has set a seal upon their hearts and upon their hearing, and over their vision is a veil.1 And for them is a great punishment."}